      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOBRIQUET (2) missed the hat-trick last start when third and beaten 8 lengths (35.39) last time at this track. Goes very well at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from three starts. Rates highly and will give a great sight. SHE'S MAYHEM (4) was always well back but did hit the line strongly late to finish 4th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (35.20) at this track. Cannot be left out. BARTLETT (1) was fast into stride from box four to score two back (30.65) then jumped from the same draw last time but got further back when 3rd at Q Lakeside (30.84). Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Hard to beat again. ROMA KEEPING (5) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
